<https://bioregistry.io/registry/babelon> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Babelon is a simple standard for managing ontology translations and language profiles. Profiles are managed as TSV files, see for example https://github.com/obophenotype/hpo-translations/tree/main/babelon. The goal of Babelon as a data model and vocabulary is to capture the minimum data required to capture important metadata such as confidence and precision of translation."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
