<https://bioregistry.io/registry/ivdb> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "IVDB hosts complete genome sequences of influenza A virus generated by BGI and curates all other published influenza virus sequences after expert annotations. IVDB provides a series of tools and viewers for analyzing the viral genomes, genes, genetic polymorphisms and phylogenetic relationships comparatively."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
