<https://bioregistry.io/registry/getty.gvp> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The GVP Ontology defines classes, properties and values (skos:Concepts) used in GVP LOD. As of version 3.0, it is complete regarding AAT, TGN and ULAN, and will be extended in time with more elements needed for other GVP vocabularies (CONA)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
