<https://bioregistry.io/registry/agilent.probe> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This is the Agilent SurePrint G3 Human GE v2 8x60k Microarray, Agilent design ID 039494, GridName 039494_D_F_20120628. Probe layout is 1 x 1 x 384 rows x 164 cols, which is different from a similar ADF A-GEOD-16699 (1 x 1 x 328 rows x 192 cols). Version 2 of this array  contains long intergenic non-coding RNA (lincRNA) probes designed to the human catalog of lincRNAs from the Broad Institute, along with an update of mRNA content when compared to version 1. Probes were designed using GRCh37 assembly of the human genome. Annotation of probes came from the following database: RefSeq Build 50, Ensembl Release 52, Unigene Build 216, GenBank (April 2009), Broad Institute Human lincRNA catalog (Nov 2011), Broad Institute TUCP transcripts catalog (Nov 2011).  Probe annotation was taken from A-GEOD-16699."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
