<https://bioregistry.io/registry/bodc.cf> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Ontology representation of the Climate and Forecast (CF) standard names parameter vocabulary, which is intended for use with climate and forecast data in the atmosphere, surface and ocean domains. Every CF parameter is captured as a SKOS concept.This vocabulary is a simplified version of the CF vocabulary P07 from the NERC Vocabulary Server (NVS), National Oceanography Centre - British Oceanographic Data Centre (BODC), https://vocab.nerc.ac.uk."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://bioregistry.io/registry/chictr> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Established in 2005 by professor Wu Taixiang and Li Youping team, West China Hospital, Sichuan University, and the Ministry of Health of China assigned it to be the representative of China to join WHO ICTRP in 2007. The Chinese Clinical Trial Registry provides the services include register for trials, consultation for trial design, central randomization for an allocation sequence, peer review for draft articles and training for peer reviewers. (from website)"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
